@Service
public class SnowpackService {
    public static final int NEW_SNOW_LIMIT_CM = 5;
    ...
    @Transactional
    public Map<String,Object> reportReading(String regionId, ReadingRequest req) {
        Instant now = clock.instant();
        Instant hour = parseHour(req.hourUtc());
        regionDao.ensureRegion(regionId, now);
        String status = regionDao.lockRegionStatus(regionId);
        // idempotent replay
        Optional<ReadingRec> existing = readingDao.findByRequestId(regionId, req.requestId());
        if (existing.isPresent()) {
            ReadingRec r = existing.get();
            if (r.hourUtc().equals(hour) && r.depthCm()==req.depthCm() && r.newSnowCm()==req.newSnowCm()) {
                return toResponse(r, false, status...);
            }
            throw ApiException.conflict("REQUEST_ID_CONFLICT", ...);
        }
        // hour occupied by another request
        Optional<ReadingRec> atHour = readingDao.findByHour(regionId, hour);
        if (atHour.isPresent()) throw conflict("READING_ALREADY_EXISTS", "该整点已有读数，仅可追加勘误");
        long id = readingDao.insertReading(...);
        boolean overLimit = req.newSnowCm() > LIMIT;
        Long closureId = null;
        if (overLimit) {
            int invalidated = reviewDao.invalidatePending(regionId, "OVER_LIMIT_READING:" + hour, now);
            if (RegionDao.OPEN.equals(status)) {
                closureId = regionDao.insertClosure(regionId, AUTO, "new snow " + ... + "cm exceeds limit", null, now);
                regionDao.updateStatus(regionId, CLOSED, now);
            }
        }
        return response with reading, overLimit, invalidatedReviews, closureId, regionStatus
    }
}
```

parseHour: Instant.parse(hourUtc) — must be whole hour: check getEpochSecond() % 3600 == 0 else 422. Also accept only "Z" ISO. Instant.parse handles "2026-10-04T10:00:00Z". If parse fails → DateTimeParseException (a RuntimeException, not IllegalArgumentException... actually DateTimeParseException extends DateTimeException extends RuntimeException). I'll catch and throw ApiException 422.

